Europe, including Germany and Austria (flooring via Parador)|Export markets across 80+ countries","expansion":"The routed capex sections of the annual report describe expansion mainly in narrative terms rather than as a project-wise capex plan. During FY26 the Company added new capacities and introduced new products, and states that with these additions it anticipates positive growth momentum in the coming year. At a standalone level borrowings increased marginally despite additional borrowings taken towards the acquisition of Clean Coats and capex for capacity enhancement, with the increase contained by efficient working capital management. The other expansion event of the year was inorganic: the …","grades":{"rel":0,"s":"","wm90":null},"industry":"Consumer Durables","isin":"INE557A01011","kpi":null,"listed_on":"","litigation":{"as_of":"","material":false,"note":"The routed annual-report text does not describe any material litigation or contingent legal proceedings against the Company."},"mdna":"Management enters FY27 with a stance of measured optimism, citing brand strength, structural portfolio diversity and execution agility against persisting geopolitical and macroeconomic challenges|H2 FY26 margin performance was lifted by structural value-enhancement exercises, and the full fiscal benefits of the Optimus programme are expected to be visible in FY27|Walls demand was propelled by volume expansion in Boards and Panels; capacity expansion and premium mix shift are the stated levers ahead|Construction Chemicals is the youngest and fastest-scaling vertical; integrating Clean Coats …","objects":null,"oem":"","one_liner":"BirlaNu (formerly HIL Limited), part of the CKA Birla Group, is a home and building products and services company spanning pipes, construction chemicals, putty, roofs, walls and floors, with manufacturing in India, Germany and Austria and a market presence in over 80 countries.","peer_panel":{"asof":"2026-08-14","industry":"Other Construction Materials","peers":[{"ebitda_margin":12.9,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"7y CAGR","mcap":2373,"name":"RAMCO INDUSTRIES LIMITED","pat":306.3,"pat_growth":8.6,"pe":7.7,"rev":1792.2,"rev_growth":8.1,"s":"RAMCOIND","source":"product","why":"shares building/materials/sheets/sustainable"},{"ebitda_margin":33.0,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"","mcap":352,"name":"TEAMTECH FORMWORK SOL LTD","pat":11.6,"pat_growth":null,"pe":30.3,"rev":53.1,"rev_growth":null,"s":"TEAMTECH","source":"product","why":"shares construction/panels/wall"},{"ebitda_margin":9.0,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"","mcap":261,"name":"SAHYADRI INDUSTRIES LTD","pat":29.0,"pat_growth":null,"pe":9.0,"rev":678.7,"rev_growth":null,"s":"SAHYADRI","source":"product","why":"shares building/construction/designer/finishes"}],"target":{"ebitda_margin":0.2,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"","mcap":1089,"name":"BIRLANU LIMITED","pat":-119.6,"pat_growth":null,"pe":null,"rev":3730.4,"rev_growth":8.1,"s":"BIRLANU"}},"plants":[{"capacity":"33 state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities","location":"India, Germany and Austria","role":"Manufacturing footprint across the home and building products portfolio"},{"capacity":"Brownfield blocks capacity commercialised in 2025-2026","location":"Chennai, India","role":"AAC blocks (Walls) brownfield expansion"},{"capacity":"Work commenced; capacity not disclosed in the report text","location":"Andhra Pradesh, India","role":"New greenfield boards plant (Walls)"},{"capacity":"Innovation centre","location":"Hyderabad, India","role":"Hyderabad Innovation Centre"},{"capacity":"3 innovation hubs","location":"India and Germany","role":"Innovation hubs / R&D centres"}],"pre":0,"products":"{\"Pipes\": [\"BirlaNu Leakproof Pipes\", \"Topline\", \"oPVC pipes\", \"Electrofusion fittings with Integrated Service Saddle\", \"Organic Based Stabilizer (OBS)\"], \"Construction Chemicals\": [\"BirlaNu Construction Chemicals\", \"Clean Coats\", \"Covermax\", \"Multifix bonder\", \"Instaplug\", \"TA1+ Tile adhesives\"], \"Putty\": [\"BirlaNu TruColour Putty\"], \"Roofs\": [\"Charminar\", \"Ultra premium roofs\"], \"Walls\": [\"BirlaNu Aerocon\", \"BirlaNu Aerocon 6X AAC Blocks\", \"Designer boards\"], \"Floors\": [\"Parador\", \"Modular ONE flooring\", \"Taterra flooring\"]}","promises":[],"promises_total":0,"promoters":"","related":"[{\"name\": \"Clean Coats Private Limited\", \"relation\": \"subsidiary\", \"note\": \"Acquired during FY26; specialty coatings and construction chemicals business that strengthens the Company's brand position in specialty coatings.\"}, {\"name\": \"Ms. Avanti Birla\", \"relation\": \"related party\", \"note\": …","risks":[{"note":"Geopolitical instability and volatility in the global economy may pose risks such as foreign exchange risk to the Company's global operations. Mitigation rests on operations, sales and supply sources diversified across multiple geographies and business segments plus an extensive global vendor network.","risk":"Macroeconomic and geopolitical instability across global operations"},{"note":"Disruptions in the supply chain may lead to fluctuations in key raw material prices such as fibre, cement, resin and wood, adversely affecting operating costs and margins. Long-term partnerships with key suppliers and a diversified global supplier network are the stated mitigants.","risk":"Raw material price volatility and supply-chain disruption"},{"note":"Failure to adopt evolving technologies may hurt operational efficiency and customer experience, while data breaches or unauthorised access could cause operational disruption and reputational damage. The Company points to advanced infrastructure at manufacturing facilities, significant investment in digitalisation and periodic IT general control and cybersecurity reviews.","risk":"Technology obsolescence and cybersecurity"},{"note":"Failure to maintain product quality and comply with applicable quality standards may adversely affect reputation and financial performance - material in a branded building-products business. Stringent quality control processes and accreditation by leading industry bodies for product certification are the stated controls.","risk":"Product quality and certification compliance"},{"note":"Because BirlaNu holds leadership positions across several product segments, its workforce attracts interest from competitors seeking experienced talent. Mitigation is through adequately staffed critical positions, structured succession planning, leadership and individual development programmes, academic partnerships and employer branding.","risk":"Human capital attrition and leadership retention"},{"note":"Failure to maintain adequate health and safety standards could create an adverse working environment and affect operational continuity. The Company runs a comprehensive Environment, Health and Safety framework, structured safety processes, regular training, periodic health check-ups and ISO-certified occupational health and safety management systems across plants.","risk":"Health and safety across manufacturing operations"},{"note":"Extreme weather events including heavy rainfall pose operational risks across business segments. Manufacturing facilities are supported by infrastructure designed to address climate-related risks, backed by a Business Continuity Plan with disaster recovery provisions.","risk":"Climate change and extreme weather disruption"},{"note":"Growing emphasis on environmental protection raises the bar on responsible practices; failure to adequately protect the environment may adversely affect reputation and long-term sustainability. Structured environmental management programmes are in place across operations.","risk":"Environmental compliance and licence to operate"}],"rpt":{},"rpt_date":"","s":"BIRLANU","sector":"Consumer Durables","sk":{"as_of":"2026-08-09","cagrs":[{"cagr":"20.7%","period":"FY2022-FY2026","segment":"Indian gems and jewellery retail industry (value)"},{"cagr":"4-5%","period":"FY2026-FY2030P","segment":"Indi